WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.120
Picture two children with the
same mother and the same father.

2
00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:09.450
They share both parents, yet each one
inherits a different genetic mix from them.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.770
So if the parents are the same, where
does each child's different mix come from?

4
00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:18.730
In this mission, you'll watch pairs of
chromosomes line up in the middle of a

5
00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:22.290
cell, just before it
divides to make gametes.

6
00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:26.750
Then you'll zoom in on a single pair, and
see what can happen at the points where

7
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:28.680
its chromatids touch.

8
00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:32.880
Your mission: find out where brothers
and sisters get their different genetic

9
00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:33.720
mixes.
